      `ErrorContextID`, `ErrorCode`, `ErrorMessage`, `TechnicalMessage`,
      `TableName`, `ColumnName`, `ProblematicValue`,
      `AllowedRange`, `ValidValueExamples`, `SuggestedFix`, `Severity`
